1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:11,080
Recall from Unit 10: heat ethanol with concentrated sulphuric acid at one hundred and forty degrees, and two molecules share one water, giving diethyl ether.

2
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:13,385
It is cheap and used in industry.

3
00:00:13,385 --> 00:00:15,872
But it only works for simple ethers.

4
00:00:15,872 --> 00:00:22,070
Mix two different alcohols and you get all three possible ethers, which are hard to separate.

